{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は友達と遊んだー\nうどん食べたー\nスタバの新しいフラペチーノ飲んだー\nウィンドショッピングしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい服いっぱいだあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JK充実"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6thシングル「ガールズルール」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装、大人ぽくできないので\n全力できゃぴきゃぴするんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム松村！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか黄色！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうですか！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕はトウモロコシ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トウモロコシガール！！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル終わっちゃったけど\nもう一度舞台立つとしたらどの役に\n挑戦しますか？\nそれと、一番好きだった台詞\n教えて下さい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつみか栄かな。\n稽古で演じてて楽しかったから！\n死ぬ直前に女優を語る\n劇的な栄かっこいい。\n飲んでないのに陶酔して\n怒鳴って暴れるいつみすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この二人、どっちも\nメイクケバいんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビでサッカー日本代表を\n見ましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴール決めたあとに\n家に帰ってきたけど、見たー！\nがんばれ！日本！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム白石のへそだし白衣装も\nかわいくてチーム橋本の\n肩だし衣装もかわいい。\nしかも肩だしには緑があるぞ！\n...どちらも捨てがたい。\n3種類全部プリチーだーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはどの衣装がお好み"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/06/05/4249196/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}